ationNumber G` definition involves understanding the `IsRomanDominatingFunction`, `romanWeight`, and the use of the `univ` in the context of `Finset (V → Fin 3)`.  The `univ` refers to the set of all possible functions from vertices *V* to the set {0, 1, 2}.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"which geng || which nauty-geng\"","Cwd":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Running command\"","toolSummary":"\"Check if geng is installed\""}}],"truncated_fields":["thinking"]}
